id: pm-rust-yilr
title: "The release workflow pins a pm CLI three weeks older than CI's, and its changelog reads are bounded"
description: "This repository pins two different pm CLI versions. CI installs 2026.8.21 to run pm health with merge drivers required; the release workflow installs 2026.8.6 for all three of its pm-changelog invocations. That older pin is not neutral: its pm health invocation is known to hang, so any step that reaches for health inside the release job inherits a silent stall rather than a failure, and the two pins disagree about item hashing, which is what makes a history drift verdict depend on which binary produced it. Separately, none of the three invocations passes the unbounded output budget and output limit controls every other fleet package passes. pm-github proved that fuse is real: it kept releasing until its tracker reached eighty-six items, then failed for ten consecutive days on a read truncated to five."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[2]: "area:release","type:defect"
created_at: "2026-08-28T15:59:27.509Z"
updated_at: "2026-08-29T05:08:06.760Z"
closed_at: "2026-08-29T05:08:06.312Z"
completed_at: "2026-08-29T05:08:06.312Z"
author: claude
acceptance_criteria: Both workflows install the same exact pm CLI version; every pm-changelog invocation in the release workflow requests a complete unbounded workspace read
resolution: fixed
expected_result: "One pm CLI version across both workflows, and a generator that refuses a partial workspace read rather than silently shortening the changelog."
actual_result: "CI, release, and local just recipes install @unbrained/pm-cli 2026.8.28; pm-changelog is 2026.8.22; every changelog invocation carries unbounded output-budget and output-limit controls; strict health and release-check pass."
comments[1]{created_at,author,text,edited_at}:
  "2026-08-28T16:00:17.177Z",claude,"CI, release, and local just recipes now install @unbrained/pm-cli 2026.8.28, while pm-changelog uses 2026.8.22. Every changelog invocation requests a complete unbounded workspace read. The release contract verifies the exact pins and forwarded output controls, and pinned strict health passes.","2026-08-29T05:08:05.386Z"
files[3]{path,scope,note}:
  .github/workflows/ci.yml,project,Unified pm health pin
  .github/workflows/release.yml,project,Unified release pin and complete read flags
  justfile,project,Unified local pin and complete read flags
